  "releaseNotes": "ver 1.11.2\nSome public method name changes for Col/Row manipulation:\nInsertRows(...)-> InsertRowsAt(...)\nInsertCols(...)-> InsertColsAt(...)\nMergeCellsRight(...)-> MergeCellsRightAt(...)\nMergeCellsDown(...)->MergeCellsDownAt(...)\n`SplitCellVertical`/`SplitCellHorizontal` methods added  (though without Undo/Redo capability)\nFixed bug with multiple TextDecorations Undo (e.g. Underline+Strikeout)\nFixed multiple paragraphs in Cells not reading in for XamlPackage/Html",
